    {
      "source": "Can be overridden by subclasses to customize <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>.",
      "translation": "可被子类重写以自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> based on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> to add\nCouchbase-specific extensions.",
      "translation": "根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> 创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>，以添加 Couchbase 特定的扩展功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a new Repository based on the metadata. Two categories of repositories can be instantiated:\n<a href=\"SimpleCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleCouchbaseRepository</code></a>. This method performs feature checks to decide which of the two categories can be\ninstantiated (eg. is N1QL available?). Instantiation is done via reflection, see\n<a href=\"#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据元数据返回一个新的 Repository。可以实例化两类仓库：<a href=\"SimpleCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleCouchbaseRepository</code></a>。此方法执行功能检查以决定哪一类可以被实例化（例如，N1QL 是否可用？）。实例化通过反射完成，请参阅 <a href=\"#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory to create <a href=\"SimpleCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleCouchbaseRepository</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "工厂用于创建<a href=\"SimpleCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support 中的类\"><code>SimpleCouchbaseRepository</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
